# Proof scripts run by scripts/run-db-proofs.sh, and therefore by the
# "Supabase migration replay" CI job, against a freshly reset local stack.
#
# A file here must: be idempotent, build its own fixtures, wrap itself in
# BEGIN/ROLLBACK, and depend on nothing but what the migrations and
# supabase/seed/seed.sql create. It must fail loudly (raise exception) rather
# than only recording a FAIL row, though the runner catches both.
#
# Everything else lives in ci.excluded with a reason. Nothing may be in
# neither: the runner fails if a .sql file is unlisted, because a proof that
# runs nowhere is the exact problem this manifest was added to fix.
care_access_request_identity_and_pending_read_window.sql
care_access_request_phone_proof.sql
doctor_time_entitlement_grantable_by_purchasable_product.sql
force_safe_patient_order_insert_defaults.sql
refund_ledger_reversal.sql
service_purchases_insert_only_via_intent_rpc.sql
symptom_red_flag_handler_pages_a_clinician.sql
critical_notification_dead_letter_without_pathway.sql
finance_posting_failures_queue.sql
payment_activation_amount_and_reference.sql

# --- Added 2026-09-05 -------------------------------------------------------
# Nineteen more, each confirmed to build every fixture it needs. Where a script
# borrowed something the live project happens to hold -- a @tarragon.test QA
# account, a hardcoded patient uuid, "the first patient in public.profiles",
# "the first spare profile with no clinical_staff row" -- that party is now
# minted here instead. The organisation is resolved from public.organisations
# (migration 20260706084837 seeds the direct-consumer org) rather than from an
# existing patient, and any entitlement is resolved by FEATURE
# (`'vitals_red_flag_doctor_escalation' = any(features)`) rather than by a
# product code, since the packs that used to carry it are is_active = false
# after the pay-per-service pivot and a by-code fixture would entitle nobody
# and pass vacuously.
acting_for_someone.sql
english_only_no_voice.sql
fertility_assessment_requests_staff_gate.sql
glucose_emergency_backstop.sql
integration_gateway.sql
medication_logs_acting_for.sql
medication_logs_append_only.sql
medication_missed_reason_routing.sql
patient_reminder_groups_rls.sql
pregnancy_antenatal_postnatal_rls.sql
red_flag_handlers_notify_phoneless_clinicians.sql
reminder_time_window.sql
reproductive_health_profiles_rls_regression_fix.sql
reproductive_health_profiles_write_side_category_scoping.sql
spo2_red_flag_engine.sql
temperature_red_flag_engine.sql
